abstract: >-
  Merit-order dispatch model of Indonesian island grids (Jawa-Bali, Sumatera, South Sulawesi) calibrated to the
  official 2024 energy mix, with average carbon intensity and model-based marginal emission signals, consequential
  evaluation of carbon-aware schedulers for delay-tolerant data-centre jobs, Sobol sensitivity analysis, a regime
  map along the solar transition, and all result tables and figures of run v10_p2b.
